# This setup's live rule: the game drive is a 1 TB Samsung T7 (serial below).
# For another setup, start from 99-piwii-drive.rules.example instead.
#
# piwii: the Wii owns the game drive (passed through as a USB gadget drive),
# so the Pi's desktop must never mount it on its own. UDISKS_IGNORE hides the
# disk and its partition from udisks (no file-manager icon); UDISKS_AUTO=0 also
# turns off automount in case a desktop component ignores the hide hint.
# Matched by serial number so a different USB disk still behaves normally.
SUBSYSTEM=="block", ENV{ID_SERIAL_SHORT}=="S6XBNS0W512374X", ENV{UDISKS_IGNORE}="1", ENV{UDISKS_AUTO}="0"
